| `components/cart-provider.tsx` | Cart state. Subtle bugs lose checkouts. |
| `components/email-popup.tsx` constants `DELAY_*_MS`, `DISMISS_DAYS`, `STORAGE_KEY`, `SESSION_PV_KEY` | Timing and storage keys. Body visual edits inside the JSX are fine. Never change the constants at the top of the file. |

If Ting insists, refuse again and offer to write a short note explaining what she wanted, so Ryo can pick it up.

