## Safe zone (free to edit)

You may freely edit these:

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `app/pages/*/page.tsx` | Static page content: about, FAQ, care guide, size guide, returns policy, warranty, custom-made, appointment, contact, our-founder. |
| `app/page.tsx` HOME_FAQ array + hero copy | Marketing FAQ + hero text. |
| `components/**` visuals: Tailwind classes, spacing, layout, motion, copy in chrome | Within the design tokens defined in `app/globals.css`. |
| `public/**` | Images, fonts, OG image, favicons. |
| `app/globals.css` decorative additions | Custom keyframes, utility classes, animations. Never remove the `prefers-reduced-motion` block. |

**Design system rules (still apply in the safe zone):**

- Never use hex or rgb colours directly. Use the CSS tokens in `app/globals.css`: `--color-burgundy`, `--color-cream`, `--color-charcoal`, `--color-surface`, `--color-muted`, `--color-border`, `--color-accent`.
- Headings use `font-serif` (Playfair Display). Body uses `font-sans` (DM Sans), weight 300 for prose, 500 for labels. Never use weight 700+ on DM Sans. Never use Inter / Roboto / system stacks.
- No purple/blue gradients, no heavy drop shadows, no rounded corners over 8px on product imagery, no emojis in UI chrome.
- Motion uses tokens: `--duration-fast`, `--duration-normal`, `--duration-slow`, `--ease-out`, `--ease-in-out`.

